title: "Global Zircon Magmatic Oxygen Fugacity Reconstruction"
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-18"
abstract: >-
  Research code and frozen inference models for zircon geochemistry-based
  magmatic oxygen fugacity (Delta FMQ) prediction, global age-binned analysis,
  source-level sensitivity testing, and regional validation.
